window.products.push({"id":1113016,"name":"Cushion Lab Extra Dense Lumbar Pillow - Patented Ergonomic Multi-Region Firm Back Support for Lower Back Pain Relief - Lumbar Support Cushion w/Strap ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511Pe45DOpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Extra Dense Ergonomic Lumbar Pillow With Specially Contoured Supports for Effective Lower Back Pressure Relief Sitting will be a brand new experience with the Cushion Lab Ergonomic Lumbar PillowOffice workers love our pillow because its ergonomic shape & firm support helps posture & alleviate back pain from long working hours. Commuters swear by our pillow because it relieves lower back pressure through specially designed contours that car or airplane seat lack. Try our pillow, You will enjoy our pronounced back support and all-day comfort. Designed by Ergonomic Specialists We worked extensively with ergonomic specialists & physical therapists to design a lumbar pillow that not only provides better back support but also promotes better posture to help further alleviate back pain. Specially Contoured for Maximum Support. Featuring specially designed contours, our pillow fits closely to your back, providing firm support from your lower back to mid-upper back for maximum back pain relief. Lasting Support with Proprietary Hyperfoam™ Hyperfoam is our extra dense, dynamically rebounding, proprietary memory foam. Unlike generic lumbar pillows, our pillow does not go flat, giving you all day back support. Breathable, Robust, & Friction-Free Cover Our cover has been thoughtfully designed to be breathable & hard-wearing. It doesn't grab onto your shirt and trap heat like velvet cover and is removable & washable for easy clean & care. Adjustable Back Strap Our pillow has a built-in elastic adjustable strap to help you tie it down to your chair or doubles as a luggage strap, so you easily take it anywhere. Instantly Back Support Anywhere Our pillow is designed to enhance back support in any environment. It works well with office chair, car & airplane seats, sofas, & even for on the bed reading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511Pe45DOpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C CUSHION LAB","source_asin":"B07YV6ZQ79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YV6ZQ79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YV6ZQ79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113017,"name":"ThisWear Funny Music Gifts Life Without Jazz Band Would B Flat Saxophone Piano Gift Coffee Mug Tea Cup Notes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614uXppuPiL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","description":"A great birthday gift for a musician or band geek gag gift. This 11 ounce white ceramic coffee mug also makes a great tea cup with its large, easy to grip C-handle. The imprinted design will display on both sides of the mug as pictured, and will stop approximately 1 inch from both sides of C-handle. The premium full color sublimation imprint creates a vibrant, long lasting, and lead-free design. Microwave and dishwasher safe for your convenience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614uXppuPiL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThisWear","source_asin":"B01LW7YFI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LW7YFI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LW7YFI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113018,"name":"Saint Dominic Bronzed Statue Friars Dominican Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WINoYt2RL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Saint Dominic was the founder of the Friars Preachers, popularly called the Dominicans. He is the Patron Saint of Astronomers. His mother had a vision while pregnant that her unborn child was a dog who would set the world on fire with a torch it carried in its mouth; a dog with a torch in its mouth became a symbol for the Order which he founded, The Order of Friars Preachers, also known as the Dominicans.This cold cast resin statue depicts Saint Dominic teaching the rosasy, a dog with a torch in its mouth by his side. The statue stands 8 1/4 inches tall, is 4 1/4 inches wide and 3 1/4 inches deep. Made of cold cast resin, it has a metallic bronzed finish, and has hand-painted gold accents, to give it the look of metal. It makes a great gift for Catholics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WINoYt2RL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Private Label","source_asin":"B0041T9LVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0041T9LVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0041T9LVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113019,"name":"Salt and Pepper Grinder Set,Modern Stainless Steel,Easy Pump and Grind Pepper,Sea Salt and Spices,Set of 2 Mills,Table Seasoning Shakers for Home,Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mq40l0LAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Add great seasoning to all your meals! You can’t get very far into a recipe without salt and pepper. Not even a boiled egg or a buttered toast is complete without salt and a pinch of pepper. In most kitchens, the salt mill is used daily, and a tool with such demand better work great every time. Did you know that once the pepper or salt is ground, it starts to oxidize and lose their potency? That’s why you end up using a larger amount than freshly ground pepper or other table seasonings. Besides, freshly ground spices release the flavors immediately adding a fuller flavor to your meals. Our Quality Utensils spice grinders have what you asked for: ✔️ Easy to fill ✔️ Easy to operate ✔️Perfect grinding ✔️Perfect Gift Idea ✔️Performance ✔️Value ✔️Quiet Mill Why Quality Utensils manual salt and pepper mills? Grind mechanism – We promise to provide a consistent and efficient grind for many years due to the stainless-steel system. The coarseness of the grind – Offers a medium to fine grinding that meets any cook’s need. Easy to use – Comfortable grip, can be operated with just one hand and an easy thumb press. The grinding rods - Will easily crush, mill and grind your favorite spices, satisfying even the most demanding grinding needs without bending or breaking. Minimalistic design - With the proper capacity for home and on the go, these mills are pleasing to the eye with timeless model and easy storage. Our Quality Utensils thumb press pepper grinders will grind your favorite table seasonings wherever you are(home, to a picnic, camping or at work). What's in the box? Salt and pepper shakers, set of 2, 6-inch-tall, no batteries needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mq40l0LAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quality-Utensils","source_asin":"B07BD3DZZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BD3DZZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BD3DZZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
