window.products.push({"id":1113021,"name":"Samger Manual Sugar Cane Juicer Machine Stainless Steel Sugar Cane Juicer Press 110LBS Output per Hour with 2\" Large Inlet, 3 Steel Rollers, Handwheel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":251.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaNshjM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍹HIGH EFFICIENCY: Equipped with three steel rollers, driven by multiple gears, and eight teeth assist each other, the sugar cane juicer machine produces 110lbs juice per hour, great for easy operation and effortless juicing, ideal for hotels, shops, schools, and parks. 🍹LARGE INLET FOR CONVENIENT USE: The large inlet fits for 2” thick sugar cane, convenient for secondary pressing, and the inclined slag discharge port is convenient for discharging the residue. The fine-toothed stainless steel drum is equipped with adjustable handle knobs to adjust the roller gap and improve the juice yield. 🍹RESIDUE-FREE SUGAR CANE JUICE: With the fine filter and copper tap, the sugar cane juice extractor could better filter residual bagasse, making sugarcane juice purer and taste better. You could even drink it as soon as it finish squeezing juice, safe and healthy. 🍹MANUAL OPERATION: Manually operated with a hand crank pulley, rust resistant, easy to install the hand wheel. The hand wheel is increased the diameter and thickened. Made of stainless steel, durable for use. Video about how to install the hand wheel is shown in the details. 🍹DECENT SERVICE: The package of the sugar cane juicer squeezer is improved to avoid shipping damage. If you have any other concerns about the installation and usage, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EaNshjM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMGER S","source_asin":"B07MNSSFW3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MNSSFW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MNSSFW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
