window.products.push({"id":1113430,"name":"Lavender Scented Candle - Funny Gift for Boyfriend Husband Him Her Girlfriend Wife - Romantic I Love You Gift for Christmas Birthday Anniversary Valen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qIoDkIM0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Funny Gifts for Lovers: With its quote “Light This When You Want My Mouth To Do Sexy Things To You”, this candle sets the perfect mood for a romantic evening with this ideal combination of message and scent. The fun text makes it a novelty and special present for man, woman, husbands, wives, girlfriends, boyfriends, valentine, fiance, bride, groom, gay or lesbian couple friends. Whether you’re in a new relationship or a long-term one, this sweet candle helps dial up the romance. Unique Presents For Many Occasions: When you want to spend happy time with your beloved, you can create an inviting and sexual atmosphere with the sensual candle, which can be used as aromatherapy. An amazing idea as a part of your thoughtful gift basket for 1st, 2nd, 3rd Anniversaries, Birthdays, Holiday, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, Valentine’s Day, Engagement, Wedding, Honeymoon, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Hanukkah, and New Year’s Day or just because. Fresh Lavender & Eucalyptus Scent: Featuring lavender and eucalyptus, the scented candle \"walks the line between seductive and soothing,\" providing an elegant, aromatic backdrop to start your night. The overall effect smells like you’re walking through a field of lavender, almost as good as a trip to Provence. It has a nice throw, great for use in Entryway, Living Room, Bathroom, Bedroom, or any room you want to add that memorable scent to! Clean & Long-Lasting Burn: Made with soy wax (vegan, paraben-free), this decorative and meaningful saying candle is hand poured in small batches so that you always receive a pure perfect candle! Cotton-core wicks and premium fragrance ensure a clean and even burn, making it destined to burn for a long time, approximately 50 hours. Through the aroma, calming light, and cleansing energy, the UOKPT candles transform and uplift the space you’re in, the best adult gift for him or her. Sophisticated & Sturdy Package: Housed in a strong recyclable glass jar with a metal lid, this personalized candle seals in the scent well and maintains its potency. The contrast of the white wax and wick with the matte black glass vessel, and the black-and-golden label are striking, making this candle grounded with any decor. Candle comes packaged in a sturdy box to guarantee it’s intact after delivery, ready to give as a gag and cute surprise for a male or female you love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qIoDkIM0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UOKPT","source_asin":"B0BQ1PMQSN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ1PMQSN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ1PMQSN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
