window.products.push({"id":1113487,"name":"LOVECASA Extra Large Kitchen Utensil Holder, 7.4\" Ceramic Utensil Holder For Kitchen Countertop With Heavy And Sturdy Base, Farmhouse Utensil Holder F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UcqE7NuQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EXTRA LARGE& SPACE SAVING】This extra large utensil holder is 7.4″H*6.3″W and can hold plenty of kitchen utensils, 7.4 inches deep enough to keep most long utensils from falling out, keeping utensils handy and findable. 【PREMIUM HEAVY DURABLE CERAMIC】Unlike common stainless steel or plastic, this ceramic holder is more stable and heavy enough not to topple over or spill all over the place, and it will not be scratched or dented, and the embossed patterns will never come off. 【VINTAGE KITCHEN DÉCOR】This classic farmhouse utensil holder with beautiful and elegant imprinted emboss adds a vintage touch to your home décor. The imprinted emboss and smooth glaze is very eye-catching and will never go out of style. 【LONG-LASTING USE】The texture of this utensil holder is anti-slip and anti-scratch. You can easily keep it clean with a wet cloth or wash it with a bit of soap. It can withstand the rigor of fast-paced kitchen and keep kitchen essentials at hand in this countertop organizer. 【MULTIPLE FUNCTION& WONDERFUL GIFT】This kitchen utensil holder is not only can be used to store kitchen utensils such as spatulas, ladles, peelers, knives, whisks, can openers, but also can be used as a cute planter pot, vase, wine freezer. And it is suitable for weddings or housewarming gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UcqE7NuQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVECASA","source_asin":"B0BB2J2PWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB2J2PWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB2J2PWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113488,"name":"MALOUF 400 Thread Count Genuine Egyptian Cotton Bed Sheet Set - White - Full XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719YpaWPqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Authentic Egyptian cotton this product is 100% authentic, single-ply, single-pick, long-staple Egyptian cotton. Yes, there was a lot we had to clarify there because there are several ways other brands try to deceive consumers. Egyptian cotton is superior to most other sheet material because of the long-staple. While the long-staple can be found in other cottons, it is most predominantly found in Egyptian grown cotton. This long-staple allows the cotton to be woven more extensively, creating a softer and more durable sheet that is resistant to pilling. The carefully crafted weave makes Egyptian cotton sheets more breathable. You can see why authentic Egyptian cotton sheets are so desirable; unfortunately, a lot of consumers are tricked into purchasing inferior products. Most oversized DimensionsMalouf manufactures their linens to the most oversized dimensions available. Fitted sheets accommodate mattress depths from 6 to 22 inches, perfect for thick mattresses or beds with mattress toppers. The ultra-thick fitted sheet elastic goes all the way around the mattress to guarantee a secure fit. Superb WorkmanshipMalouf's Egyptian cotton is finely woven to produce a true 400 thread count, but thread count alone is not the best way to measure Egyptian cotton quality. The single-ply cotton is mercerized to strengthen the fibers, give them a more lustrous appearance and a softer feel. Designed in the U.S., Imported materials were used to provide the highest levels of quality and comfort. Available in white, ivory, khaki, chocolate, silver sage, and slate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719YpaWPqsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B004QIO8CI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004QIO8CI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004QIO8CI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113489,"name":"RUGGABLE Washable Stain Resistant Indoor/Outdoor, Kids, Pets, and Dog Friendly Accent Rug, 3'x5', Cadiz Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uPoWejCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester MACHINE WASHABLE 2-PIECE RUG SYSTEM - A decorative and machine washable Rug Cover combines with a cushioned non-slip Rug Pad to create Ruggable's stylish and durable area rugs. Toss the cover in the washer/dryer and voilà, your Ruggable is ready to use again! Ruggable rugs stay looking clean and fresh, all while protecting your floors. PET AND KID FRIENDLY - Whether Junior spills his juice or Fido's fur has you in a frenzy, Ruggable's machine washable, water repellent, and stain resistant design can handle the daily wear and tear of a bustling household. The non-slip pad provides cushioning, thickness and security, keeping your Ruggable firmly in place under toddler feet and puppy paws. SAVES TIME AND MONEY - No more wasting time and money on professional rug cleaning services; with Ruggable, clean-up is easy, convenient, and affordable. Instead of spending time cleaning or renting specialty equipment, you can enjoy relaxing in the comfort of your home. ECO-FRIENDLY AND SUSTAINABLE - With Ruggable's patented system, wash and reuse your rug cover whenever you need, avoiding the waste and cost of frequently replacing rugs. The Rug Cover is 100% eco-friendly and sustainable polyester, and the Rug Pad is made from 100% polyester surface from recycled plastic bottles with TPR (thermoplastic resin) non-slip backing. VERSATILE - Ruggable rugs are available in a variety of colors and patterns to suit any home decor style. Their pleasing and practical design is perfect for any room in your home: the entryway, mud room, living room, dining room, bathroom, rec room, kid's room, nursery, and all types of flooring. These are indoor/outdoor rugs, so you can even use them outside your front door or out on the patio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91uPoWejCqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUGGABLE","source_asin":"B07KG53GWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KG53GWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KG53GWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
