window.products.push({"id":1113698,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Fan, Personal Space Air Cooler Quiet Desk Fan Mini Evaporative Cooler with Timing Function Battery or USB for Home Office Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ndWqG-0QL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do You Want to Enjoy Cool Air, Anywhere in Summer? Try our portable compact personal air cooler. It pulls warm air from the room through its evaporative water filter to fill any space with cool,humidifies aand clean comfortable air! You can add pure water,small ice cube. in the water tank, plug it into any standard wall outlet and enjoy! It’s Not Designed To Cool A Whole Room,But It Is Intended To Send Cool,Cold,Or Humidified Air Approx 3.2ft Max To Where You Need It,On You!Cool And Comfortable And The Multi Speed Cooling And 2-Way Air Direction Help Spread The Air Evenly Throughout The Room. It is 2 speeds(High, Low) ,and 1-12h Automatic Timing, you can adjust it easily. The wind outlet blade can be 80°adjusted up and down like air conditioning,no fan blades expose,safety to children and pets.You can use at home and office Attention Please 1. Please keep remind to add pure water, to Avoid Impurities affecting the cooling function. 2. Adding 3/4 Water in the Tank is the best, Do Not Full Filled. 3. Recommend to clean the water tank once a week to clear scale 4. If you would like to enjoy cooling wind you can ice cube in the water tank. 5. When have water in the tank,please keep it level,remember to move in paralle,don't lean it . Package include 1* Portable Air Cooler 1* Adapter Cable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ndWqG-0QL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cakie","source_asin":"B087NZYPN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087NZYPN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087NZYPN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
