window.products.push({"id":1113832,"name":"Bless the Food Before Us Sign Farmhouse Kitchen Wall Decor Rustic Dining Room Wall Art Decor Living Room Decorations Country Vintage Kitchen Hanging W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LFQl-zeQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅CUTE KITCHEN WALL DECOR: This dining room decor consists of 5 piece irregularly shaped plaques with the pop saying: bless the food before us, the family beside us, and the love between us, amen. It is not only a wonderful kitchen decor clearance, but also a great reminder for prayer before meal to be grateful and cherish family and love each other. ✅UNIQUE DESIGN & PERFECT SIZE: Each rustic kitchen signs is meticulously designed, the bless font uses a 3D shape plaque, and the food before us uses a meat-shaped, which looks more lively and beautiful. Each board uses a different color and creates a vintage rusitc sense. The overall size is: 20.6inch × 11.8inch, very suitable for hanging in the kitchen, dining room, cafe restaurant, canteen bar and any place you want to hang. RELIABLE & DURABLE MATERIAL:Stop using cheap materials to decorate your kitchen or dining room, why not try our kitchen decoration? It is made of 0.32inch/0.8cm medium density fiberboard (MDF) recycled wood, which is durable, environmentally friendly, non-toxic & no unpleasant smell; it is firmly fixed with a thick enough hemp rope, and no need to worry about falling; UV printing is colorful, clear and will never fade, unlike other cheaps that just stick a color sticker on the board. ✅AN ENCHANTING GIFT: Reliable materials, perfect workmanship, and clever design are simply a great work of art also is definitely the focal point of the kitchen or dining room.This farmhouse kitchen decor must be a great choice as a gift for your family, neighbors, colleague and friends. Order now and get it as a thoughtful gift for wedding, birthdays, thanksgiving, christmas, housewarming, various anniversaries, etc. ✅NEED MORE TIME TO DECIDE?: Our kitchen art wall decor is absolute value for money and will be not disappoint you. We strive to provide each customer with high-quality products and service. If the kitchen signs you receive is defective or not like, PLEASE CONTACT US FIRST, we will reply in time and provide replacement or refund services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LFQl-zeQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baihui","source_asin":"B09GJLQGSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GJLQGSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GJLQGSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1113833,"name":"Set of 3 vintage white clay\"thankful grateful blessed\" Thanksgiving pumpkins, hand stamped brown text","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518sjKuo+LL.jpg","description":"Are you thankful, grateful and blessed? Me too. Three of the most darling little pumpkins you will ever lay eyes on. Handmade by me, and then stamped with words. I don't ever use molds or templates to make my sculptures, they are totally handmade from start to finish by me. Made of polymer clay and painted, and finished with a coat of high quality clear varnish. Just line them up on your mantle, somewhere in your cubicle, a window sill, just about anywhere for instant cuteness. You won't be able to stand it. Each pumpkin is about 1 3/4\" high x 1 3/4\" wide. Thanx for looking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518sjKuo+LL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01JDIPXYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JDIPXYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JDIPXYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
