window.products.push({"id":1113853,"name":"Casamico Bamboo Foil Dispenser with Cutter - 2-in-1 with Built-in Plastic Slicer - Foil Organizer for Drawer - Wrap Dispenser for Cling wrap - Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DJcH038IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you need help tidying up your kitchen food wraps? You just had dinner with your family, and all that’s left is a juicy piece of steak. It’s still big and worth saving, so you decide to store it in the fridge. For that, you can use cling wrap. But after rummaging through your drawers, you can’t seem to find it! The problem here is that you don’t organize your wraps. Luckily, you can make kitchen organization, meal prep, and managing leftovers much easier with the right foil dispenser. The Casamico Bamboo Wrap Dispenser with Cutter keeps your wraps in one place. Declutter your kitchen with this 2in1 holder! Place up to 2 12'' width rolls at a time and keep the dispenser somewhere near or drawer so you can always grab a piece of wrap whenever needed. Placing food wraps inside is easy, too, thanks to the simple sliding door. Cut wraps with zero effort. The holder's builtin cutter glides smoothly–no catching or snagging. Sheets won't block the cutter when stretched out, letting you make clean cuts. Not only is using the cutter faster, but it’s also much safer than using scissors or the metal teeth that are in most wrap boxes. To make this kitchen accessory more ecoresponsible and minimize our reliance on plastic, this dispenser only comes with one cutter in the middle–because one is all you'll really need. Speaking of ecoresponsibility, this dispenser is also made with bamboo. Bamboo is a fastgrowing grass that barely requires any help to thrive, making it a more sustainable choice compared to wood or synthetic materials. It's also extremely durable, making the holder perfect for busy kitchens and homes. More reasons to take home this holder: Bamboo lends the dispenser a chic, rustic charm Lightweight at only 2.09lbs Great housewarming gift idea Upgrade the way you store and use kitchen rolls. Add the Casamico Bamboo Wrap Dispenser to your cart TODAY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DJcH038IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casamico","source_asin":"B0B41WN1R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B41WN1R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B41WN1R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
