window.products.push({"id":1113892,"name":"Aluminum Pizza Peel 12 inch x 14 inch with Foldable Wooden Handle - Metal Pizza Spatula for Indoor and Outdoor Oven - Easy Storage Pizza Paddle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrjVXdm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alani Kitchen’s Aluminum Pizza Peel is all you need to make better-than-pizzeria pizza. It’s a welcomed addition that brings fun and ease to any pizza making process and is the perfect gift for every pizza lover! No More Oven Disasters This light weight yet sturdy metal pizza paddle will become your new best friend in the kitchen ! Not only will it save you from dropping your pizza on its’ way to the oven, but its’ versatility makes it great for transferring other foods like breads, cakes, and pies—all without burning your hands. How to Clean and Store Away This pizza shovel is easy to hand-wash. Simply turn the metal knob to detach the wooden handle, lightly scrub the peel with a soft sponge and then thoroughly dry. When you’re done, reattach the handle and flip it around for easy drawer storage or fully extend the handle to hang with the faux leather loop . 3 Best Practices One , the pizza spatula paddle works best when sprinkled with flour or cornmeal. This allows for the dough to easily slide from the peel and onto a pizza stone within the oven. Two , use a cutting board to slice your pizza, not the peel. This will save your blades and your pizza peel. Three , your peel is not dishwasher safe, so make sure to hand-wash. Specifications Handle is solid oak and hand-stained BLACK The pizza spatula comes detached in four parts (peel, handle, screw and knob) Size: 12” x 25” (fully extended) and 12” x 14” (folded) Our Guarantee You deserve the best and to ensure that’s what you receive, we offer a 1-year manufacturer guarantee . If you’re unhappy for any reason, please reach out to us and we’ll replace your Aluminum Pizza Peel quickly and for free. Scroll up and click “Buy Now”.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrjVXdm-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alani Kitchen","source_asin":"B08DHPR4CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DHPR4CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DHPR4CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
