window.products.push({"id":1113911,"name":"SuperStone / 9\" x 8\" Bread Dome Baker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615s9f6ZS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superstone bread dome is a baker's dream dish. This covered bread baker replicates traditional breadmaking in an adobe oven, producing superior-tasting, golden-crusted bread with crackly crust. Durable, thick stoneware casserole distributes heat evenly, ensuring center and edges of bread bake uniformly. The dome lid circulates heat, and vent hole releases just the right amount of steam to retain interior moistness and flavor. Deep circular shape of this covered bread baker allows even rising of dough to create a lofty, artisanal masterpiece. Ideal environment to bake \"no knead\" bread. This round baker with glazed bottom interior and unglazed lid is the perfect baking dish to slow-roast beef tenderloin, pork shoulder or herbed chicken. Natural, heat-retentive qualities of stoneware reduce baking time, while producing moist, succulent entrees. Smooth bottom ensures easy release. Also ideal to bake seasoned dressing or vegetables and retain heat on the table for serving. Side handles allow balanced control lifting from oven onto cooling rack or table. Works best in conventional and convection ovens. Microwave-safe. Oven-safe to 500 F. Hand wash. Product Features All-natural stoneware bread dome bakes golden artisan bread with a perfect crackly crust Replicates traditional breadmaking in an adobe oven Thick composition distributes heat evenly, ensuring center and edges of bread bake evenly Dome lid circulates heat, ensuring uniform baking Deep circular bowl allows even rising of dough Perfect baker to roast beef tenderloin, pork or chicken Natural heat-retentive qualities of stoneware reduce baking time and retain moistness of foods Ideal to bake seasoned dressing or vegetables and retain heat on the table for serving Side handles for easy transport","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615s9f6ZS2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sassafras","source_asin":"B005VWOZ4E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1113911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005VWOZ4E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005VWOZ4E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
